OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSALeader of flag campaign pleads not
OL,4,Aguilty to offences
OL,5,
OL,6,FThames Valley Police charged Bridge in
OL,7,FSeptember with 14 offences from a
OL,8,Ftwo-month period in Oxfordshire from 31
OL,9,FJanuary 2026.
OL,11,FHe is due to appear at Oxford Crown
OL,12,FCourt on 3 December in connection with
OL,13,Fthree counts of racially aggravated
OL,14,Fharassment, one count of common assault
OL,15,Fand one count of public order.
